---
import { site } from '../site.config';
import Crate from './Crate.astro';
---

<div class="cart" data-cart aria-hidden="true" data-email={site.email}>
  <div class="cart__veil" data-cart-close></div>
  <aside class="cart__panel" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="cart-title" data-cart-panel>
    <header class="cart__head">
      <h2 id="cart-title" class="cart__title">Ma <em>demande</em></h2>
      <button class="cart__x" type="button" data-cart-close aria-label="Fermer"><span></span><span></span></button>
    </header>

    <div class="cart__scroll" data-lenis-prevent>
      <div class="cart__crate"><Crate compact /></div>
      <p class="cart__empty" data-cart-empty>
        <span class="muted">Déposez quelques pots dans votre panier, puis revenez ici pour nous envoyer votre demande.</span>
        <a href="#boutique" class="btn" data-cart-close>Composer mon panier</a>
      </p>
      <ul class="cart__items" data-cart-items></ul>

      <form class="cart__form" id="cart-form" data-cart-form>
        <p class="label cart__form-h">Pour vous rappeler</p>
        <label class="field">
          <span class="label">Nom &amp; prénom</span>
          <input name="name" required autocomplete="name" />
        </label>
        <div class="field-row">
          <label class="field">
            <span class="label">Téléphone</span>
            <input name="phone" type="tel" required autocomplete="tel" />
          </label>
          <label class="field">
            <span class="label">E-mail</span>
            <input name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" />
          </label>
        </div>
        <fieldset class="field field--choice">
          <legend class="label">Récupération</legend>
          <label><input type="radio" name="pickup" value="Retrait à Louargat" checked /> Retrait à Louargat</label>
          <label><input type="radio" name="pickup" value="Remise en main propre, à convenir" /> À convenir</label>
        </fieldset>
        <label class="field">
          <span class="label">Message (facultatif)</span>
          <textarea name="message" rows="2"></textarea>
        </label>
      </form>

      <div class="sent" data-sent hidden>
        <p class="script sent__title">Merci !</p>
        <p>Votre messagerie devrait s’ouvrir avec la demande déjà rédigée. Si rien ne s’ouvre, copiez le message et envoyez-le à :</p>
        <p class="sent__mail"><span data-sent-mail>{site.email}</span></p>
        <textarea class="sent__text" id="sent-text" readonly rows="8" data-sent-text aria-label="Texte de la demande"></textarea>
        <div class="sent__actions">
          <button type="button" class="btn" data-sent-copy><span class="btn__dot"></span><span data-sent-copy-label>Copier le message</span></button>
          <button type="button" class="btn btn--ghost" data-sent-back>Modifier</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <footer class="cart__foot" data-cart-foot>
      <div class="cart__total">
        <span class="label">Estimation</span>
        <span class="cart__sum" data-cart-total>0€</span>
      </div>
      <button class="btn cart__send" type="submit" form="cart-form" data-cart-send>
        <span class="btn__dot"></span>Envoyer ma demande
      </button>
      <p class="cart__note label">Aucun paiement en ligne · nous vous rappelons</p>
    </footer>
  </aside>
</div>

<button class="dock" type="button" data-cart-open data-dock aria-label="Voir ma demande">
  <span class="dock__jars" data-dock-jars aria-hidden="true"></span>
  <span class="dock__txt"><span class="label">Ma demande</span><span class="dock__sum"><span data-cart-count>0</span> pot(s) · <span data-cart-total>0€</span></span></span>
  <span class="dock__go" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
</button>

<style>
  .cart {
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: 80;
    visibility: hidden;
  }
  .cart__veil {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: rgb(22 16 11 / 0.45);
    backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
    opacity: 0;
  }
  .cart__panel {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    right: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    width: min(100%, 520px);
    background: var(--ivory);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    border-radius: 24px 0 0 24px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .cart__head {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 1.6rem 1.6rem 1rem;
  }
  .cart__title {
    font-size: 2.6rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1;
  }
  .cart__title em {
    color: var(--amber);
  }
  .cart__x {
    width: 46px;
    height: 46px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px currentColor;
    position: relative;
    transition: transform 0.5s var(--ease);
  }
  .cart__x:hover {
    transform: rotate(90deg);
  }
  .cart__x span {
    position: absolute;
    left: 14px;
    right: 14px;
    top: 50%;
    height: 1.2px;
    background: currentColor;
    transform: rotate(45deg);
  }
  .cart__x span + span {
    transform: rotate(-45deg);
  }
  .cart__scroll {
    flex: 1;
    overflow-y: auto;
    overscroll-behavior: contain;
    padding: 0 1.6rem 1.6rem;
  }
  .cart__empty {
    display: grid;
    justify-items: start;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    padding-block: 2rem;
  }
  .cart__crate {
    margin: 2.2rem auto 0.4rem;
    width: 88%;
  }
  .cart__empty .btn {
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }
  :global(.has-items) .cart__empty {
    display: none;
  }
  .cart__items {
    list-style: none;
  }
  .cart__items :global(li) {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 64px 1fr auto;
    gap: 1rem;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 1rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--ink) 12%, transparent);
  }
  .cart__items :global(.ci-jar) {
    width: 64px;
    height: 64px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    background: var(--cream);
  }
  .cart__items :global(.ci-jar i) {
    width: 26px;
    height: 32px;
    border-radius: 6px 6px 9px 9px;
    background: linear-gradient(160deg, var(--c1), var(--c2));
    box-shadow: inset 0 6px 0 #1b1511;
  }
  .cart__items :global(.ci-name) {
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    font-style: italic;
    line-height: 1.1;
  }
  .cart__items :global(.ci-meta) {
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }
  .cart__items :global(.ci-qty) {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    margin-top: 0.4rem;
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .cart__items :global(.ci-qty button) {
    width: 28px;
    height: 28px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px color-mix(in srgb, var(--ink) 30%, transparent);
  }
  .cart__items :global(.ci-price) {
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    text-align: right;
  }
  .cart__items :global(.ci-rm) {
    display: block;
    margin-left: auto;
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 0.66rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
  .cart__form {
    display: none;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: 1.6rem;
  }
  :global(.has-items) .cart__form {
    display: grid;
  }
  .cart__form-h {
    color: var(--amber);
  }
  .field {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.35rem;
    border: 0;
    min-width: 0;
  }
  .field .label,
  .field legend {
    font-size: 0.62rem;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }
  .field input,
  .field textarea {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 0.7rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--ink) 30%, transparent);
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    outline: none;
    border-radius: 0;
    transition: border-color 0.3s;
  }
  .field input:focus,
  .field textarea:focus {
    border-color: var(--honey);
  }
  .field textarea {
    resize: none;
  }
  .field-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1rem;
  }
  .field--choice {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem 1.2rem;
  }
  .field--choice legend {
    width: 100%;
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
  }
  .field--choice label {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }
  .field--choice input {
    accent-color: var(--amber);
  }
  .sent {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.9rem;
    padding-block: 1.4rem;
  }
  .sent[hidden] {
    display: none;
  }
  .sent__title {
    font-size: 3rem;
    line-height: 1;
    color: var(--brown);
  }
  .sent__mail {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    font-style: italic;
    user-select: all;
  }
  .sent__text {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 0.9rem;
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: var(--cream);
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    resize: vertical;
  }
  .sent__actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.6rem;
  }
  :global(.cart.is-sent) .cart__form,
  :global(.cart.is-sent) .cart__items,
  :global(.cart.is-sent) .cart__foot {
    display: none !important;
  }
  .cart__foot {
    padding: 1.2rem 1.6rem calc(1.2rem + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
    border-top: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--ink) 12%, transparent);
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.9rem;
    background: var(--cream);
  }
  .cart__total {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: baseline;
  }
  .cart__sum {
    font-size: 2.2rem;
    line-height: 1;
  }
  .cart__send {
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .cart__note {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 0.6rem;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }
  :global(html:not(.has-items)) .cart__foot {
    display: none;
  }

  /* Pastille flottante */
  .dock {
    position: fixed;
    z-index: 58;
    right: var(--gutter);
    bottom: calc(18px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.9rem;
    padding: 0.55rem 0.6rem 0.55rem 0.9rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--ink);
    color: var(--ivory);
    box-shadow: 0 18px 40px -12px rgb(22 16 11 / 0.55);
    transform: translateY(160%);
    transition: transform 0.8s var(--ease);
  }
  :global(.dock.is-on) {
    transform: translateY(0);
  }
  :global(html.cart-open) .dock,
  :global(html.menu-open) .dock {
    transform: translateY(160%);
  }
  .dock__jars {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-end;
    height: 30px;
  }
  .dock__jars :global(i) {
    width: 16px;
    height: 20px;
    margin-left: -6px;
    border-radius: 3px 3px 5px 5px;
    background: linear-gradient(160deg, var(--c1), var(--c2));
    box-shadow:
      inset 0 4px 0 #0f0b08,
      0 0 0 1.5px var(--ink);
  }
  .dock__jars :global(i:first-child) {
    margin-left: 0;
  }
  .dock__txt {
    display: grid;
    line-height: 1.15;
    text-align: left;
  }
  .dock__txt .label {
    font-size: 0.58rem;
    color: var(--gold);
  }
  .dock__sum {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-style: italic;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .dock__go {
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--honey);
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family: var(--sans);
  }

  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .dock {
      left: 50%;
      right: auto;
      translate: -50% 0;
    }
    .cart__panel {
      top: auto;
      height: 92svh;
      width: 100%;
      border-radius: 22px 22px 0 0;
    }
    .field-row {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
